{
  "id": "kanazawa-daytrips",
  "title": {
    "ja": "金沢から日帰りで行けるおすすめ",
    "en": "Day Trips from Kanazawa"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "時間に余裕があれば、ぜひ検討してほしい場所です。\n\n金沢市内だけでも十分楽しめますが、もう少し時間があるなら、近くへの日帰り旅も本当におすすめです。\n\nその日の天気や気分で行き先を選んで、無理をせず、自分らしく旅を楽しんでください。",
    "en": "Places you can visit on a day trip from Kanazawa. If you have extra time, definitely consider them.\n\nKanazawa City alone is already very enjoyable, but if you have extra time, I really think it's worth taking a day trip somewhere nearby as well.\n\nJust choose places based on the weather and your mood that day, don't push yourself too hard, and enjoy the trip your own way."
  },
  "area": "北陸（石川・富山・福井）",
  "tags": [
    "kanazawa",
    "hokuriku",
    "daytrip"
  ],
  "line": false,
