      "no": 1,
      "name": {
        "ja": "加賀温泉（山中温泉・山代温泉）",
        "en": "Kaga Onsen (Yamanaka Onsen / Yamashiro Onsen)"
      },
      "heading": null,
      "lat": 36.246831,
      "lng": 136.373203,
      "color": "#D95B6A",
      "access": {
        "ja": "金沢から新幹線・特急で約30分",
        "en": "Approx. 30 mins by Shinkansen / Limited Express from Kanazawa"
      },
      "time": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "hours": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "金沢が雨の日や、歩き疲れて足がくたくたのときに、温泉でしっかりくつろぐのにぴったりです。\n山中温泉と山代温泉は1日で両方回ることもできるので、時間があれば組み合わせるのもおすすめです。",
        "en": "If the weather in Kanazawa is rainy, or if your legs are tired from walking, this is a great way to relax properly in a hot spring.\nYou can also visit both in one day, so if you have time, it can be nice to combine them."
      },
      "subs": [
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "山中温泉（やまなかおんせん）",
            "en": "Yamanaka Onsen"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "鶴仙渓（かくせんけい）の川沿いの遊歩道がとても気持ちよく、30分歩くだけでも大満足。共同浴場の近くにある「いづみや精肉店」のコロッケとメンチカツもぜひ食べてみてください。",
            "en": "The Kakusenkei Gorge riverside walking path is really pleasant, and even just a 30-minute walk there feels very satisfying. I also highly recommend trying the croquettes and minced meat cutlets at Izumiya Seinikuten, near the public bathhouse."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yamanaka+Onsen"
        },
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "いづみや精肉店",
            "en": "Izumiya Seinikuten"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "山中温泉の共同浴場の近く。コロッケとメンチカツがおすすめです。",
            "en": "Near the public bathhouse in Yamanaka Onsen. Try the croquettes and minced meat cutlets."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Izumiya+Seinikuten+Yamanaka+Onsen"
        },
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "山代温泉（やましろおんせん）",
            "en": "Yamashiro Onsen"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "いかにも「温泉街」らしい雰囲気を味わいたいなら、こちらがおすすめです。",
            "en": "If you want more of a classic hot spring town atmosphere, this is the better choice."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Yamashiro+Onsen"
        }
      ],
