    {
      "no": 2,
      "name": {
        "ja": "合掌造りの集落：五箇山（ごかやま）・白川郷",
        "en": "Gassho-zukuri villages: Gokayama / Shirakawa-go"
      },
      "heading": null,
      "lat": 36.426006,
      "lng": 136.935478,
      "color": "#4E8F3A",
      "access": {
        "ja": "金沢から高速バスで約1時間〜1時間15分",
        "en": "Approx. 1 hour to 1 hour 15 mins by highway bus from Kanazawa"
      },
      "time": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "hours": {
        "ja": null,
        "en": null
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "白川郷はとても有名で大人気ですが、五箇山にも美しい合掌造りの集落があります。\n白川郷に比べると混雑しにくく、ゆっくりしたペースで楽しみやすいのが魅力。外国人観光客も少なめに感じることがあり、のんびりした空気です。冬の雪景色は本当に絶景です。",
        "en": "Shirakawa-go is very famous and very popular, but Gokayama also has beautiful gassho-zukuri villages.\nCompared with Shirakawa-go, these places are often less crowded, which makes them easier to enjoy at a slower pace. Sometimes there also seem to be fewer international tourists, so the atmosphere feels more relaxed. And in winter, the snowy scenery is absolutely beautiful."
      },
      "subs": [
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "相倉（あいのくら）合掌造り集落",
            "en": "Ainokura"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "比較的大きめの集落で、雰囲気が素晴らしいです。混雑しにくいことが多いのも、特におすすめする理由のひとつです。",
            "en": "This is a relatively larger village with a wonderful atmosphere. It's often less crowded, which is one of the reasons I especially recommend it."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ainokura+Gassho+Heritage+Village"
        },
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "菅沼（すがぬま）合掌造り集落",
            "en": "Suganuma"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "こぢんまりとした小さな集落で、とても愛らしい雰囲気です。",
            "en": "This one is smaller and more compact, with a very charming feel."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Suganuma+Gassho+Heritage+Village"
