      "description": {
        "ja": "伝統的なものづくりの現場を見ながら、日本の文化を体験できるとても面白い場所です。\n工場見学は無料で参加でき、自分で工芸品を作れる体験工房もあります。工場見学・体験ともに、公式サイトから事前に予約しておくのがおすすめです。",
        "en": "This is a really interesting place where you can see traditional craftsmanship in action and experience Japanese culture through manufacturing.\nYou can join a factory tour for free, and there are also hands-on workshops where you can make your own craft item. I recommend reserving both the factory tour and the workshop in advance through the official website."
      },
