      "description": {
        "ja": "富山には金沢とはまた違う魅力があります。少し都会的な雰囲気と港町らしさ、そしてとても充実した食が合わさった街です。",
        "en": "Toyama has a different appeal from Kanazawa. It combines a slightly more urban feel with the charm of a port town and a very strong food scene."
      },
      "subs": [
        {
          "name": {
            "ja": "富山市ガラス美術館",
            "en": "Glass Art Museum"
          },
          "text": {
            "ja": "建物そのものが美しく、展示も見ごたえがあります。",
            "en": "The building itself is beautiful, and the exhibitions are well worth seeing."
          },
          "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Toyama+Glass+Art+Museum"
